{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-42509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47837","text":"--- name: deliberate description: Use when retrieve returns routing \"deliberate\", when κ > 0 is detected, before high-stakes decisions with cyclic knowledge, or when the user asks to \"deliberate\", \"reason through cycles\", \"analyze topology\", \"think through this carefully\". For detecting contradictions use "},{"id":"spn-47838","marks":["code"],"text":"belief"},{"id":"spn-47839","text":"; this skill reasons through cyclic structures once detected. Routes through the "},{"id":"spn-47840","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-47841","text":" machine. argument-hint: <question or decision to deliberate on> ---"}]},{"id":"blk-42510","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47842","text":"Topology and Deliberation"}]},{"id":"blk-42511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47843","text":"Detect and reason through circular dependencies (cycles) in knowledge."}]},{"id":"blk-42512","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47844","text":"Key Concepts"}]},{"id":"blk-42513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47845","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-47846","text":" is the cycle-complexity invariant — it measures how entangled the knowledge is:"}]},{"id":"blk-42514","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47847","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 0"},{"id":"spn-47848","text":" — acyclic DAG, no cycles. Safe for fast retrieval."}]}],"id":"blk-42515","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47849","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 1"},{"id":"spn-47850","text":" — simple cycle (A->B->C->A). Deliberation may help for high-stakes decisions."}]}],"id":"blk-42517","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42520","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47851","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 2+"},{"id":"spn-47852","text":" — nested/overlapping cycles. Deliberation strongly recommended."}]}],"id":"blk-42519","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42521","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47853","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCCs (Strongly Connected Components)"},{"id":"spn-47854","text":" are maximal cyclic clusters — groups of nodes where every node can reach every other node through directed edges."}]},{"id":"blk-42522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47855","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fault-line edges"},{"id":"spn-47856","text":" are the weakest links in a cycle — the assumptions most likely to be wrong. Examining these first is the fastest path to resolving contradictions."}]},{"id":"blk-42523","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47857","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-42524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47858","text":"Question to deliberate: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-42525","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47859","text":"Analyze Topology"}]},{"id":"blk-42526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47860","text":"Read-only diagnostic — understand the structure:"}]},{"id":"blk-42527","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"blk-42528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47861","marks":["bold"],"text":"Parameters:"}]},{"id":"blk-42529","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47862","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-47863","text":" (optional) — explicit array of node IDs to analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-42530","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47864","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-47865","text":" (optional) — retrieve nodes by query, then analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-42532","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47866","text":"Neither — analyzes full graph"}]}],"id":"blk-42534","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42536","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47867","text":"If both "},{"id":"spn-47868","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-47869","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-47870","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-47871","text":" are provided, "},{"id":"spn-47872","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-47873","text":" takes precedence."}]},{"id":"blk-42537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47874","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-42538","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42540","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47875","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-47876","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47877","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-47878","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-47879","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""}]}],"id":"blk-42539","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42542","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47880","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-47881","text":" — highest kappa value found"}]}],"id":"blk-42541","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47882","marks":["code"],"text":"sccs"},{"id":"spn-47883","text":" — array of strongly connected components, each with its own "},{"id":"spn-47884","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-47885","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-47886","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"}]}],"id":"blk-42543","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42546","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47887","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-47888","text":" — weakest edges in cycles (examine these first)"}]}],"id":"blk-42545","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42548","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47889","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation_budget"},{"id":"spn-47890","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47891","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-47892","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-47893","marks":["code"],"text":"focus_edges"},{"id":"spn-47894","text":" to guide deliberation effort"}]}],"id":"blk-42547","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42550","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47895","marks":["code"],"text":"recommendation"},{"id":"spn-47896","text":" — human-readable guidance"}]}],"id":"blk-42549","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42552","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47897","marks":["code"],"text":"selection"},{"id":"spn-47898","text":" — how nodes were resolved (explicit/query/full_graph)"}]}],"id":"blk-42551","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47899","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate"},{"id":"spn-47900","text":" — whether analysis used approximation for large graphs"}]}],"id":"blk-42553","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42555","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47901","text":"Deliberate Through Cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-42556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47902","text":"Reason through cyclic knowledge and optionally persist conclusions:"}]},{"id":"blk-42557","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"deliberate\",\n  query: \"Should we use approach A or B given the conflicting evidence?\",\n  node_ids: [\"<node1>\", \"<node2>\"],\n  write_back: true\n)"},{"id":"blk-42558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47903","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-42559","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47904","marks":["code"],"text":"conclusions"},{"id":"spn-47905","text":" — array of resolved conclusions, each with "},{"id":"spn-47906","marks":["code"],"text":"source_scc_id"},{"id":"spn-47907","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47908","marks":["code"],"text":"source_kappa"},{"id":"spn-47909","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47910","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_lines_examined"}]}],"id":"blk-42560","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42563","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47911","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.converged"},{"id":"spn-47912","text":" — whether deliberation reached stable conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-42562","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42565","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47913","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.iterations_used"},{"id":"spn-47914","text":" — how many reasoning passes were needed"}]}],"id":"blk-42564","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42567","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47915","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.topology_change"},{"id":"spn-47916","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47917","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_before"},{"id":"spn-47918","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47919","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_after"},{"id":"spn-47920","text":", "},{"id":"spn-47921","marks":["code"],"text":"new_nodes_created"}]}],"id":"blk-42566","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42568","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47922","text":"When to use "},{"id":"spn-47923","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back"}]},{"id":"blk-42569","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42571","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47924","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: true"},{"id":"spn-47925","text":" — crystallizes conclusions as new nodes. Use when you've reached a resolution you want to persist (reduces kappa for future retrievals)."}]}],"id":"blk-42570","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42573","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47926","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: false"},{"id":"spn-47927","text":" — reasoning only, no graph changes. Use for exploration or when you're not confident in the conclusion yet."}]}],"id":"blk-42572","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-42574","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47928","text":"Full Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-42575","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47929","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-47930","marks":["bold"],"text":"Detect"},{"id":"spn-47931","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47932","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-47933","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-47934","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-47935","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-47936","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnose"},{"id":"spn-47937","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47938","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-47939","text":" for detailed cycle info and fault-lines 3. "},{"id":"spn-47940","marks":["bold"],"text":"Examine fault-lines"},{"id":"spn-47941","text":" — inspect the weakest edges identified in step 2 4. "},{"id":"spn-47942","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deliberate"},{"id":"spn-47943","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-47944","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-47945","text":" to reason through and resolve 5. "},{"id":"spn-47946","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify"},{"id":"spn-47947","text":" — re-run "},{"id":"spn-47948","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-47949","text":" to confirm kappa decreased after resolution"}]},{"id":"blk-42576","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-47950","text":"When NOT to deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-42577","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42579","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47951","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-47952","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"fast\""},{"id":"spn-47953","text":" — normal retrieval is sufficient"}]}],"id":"blk-42578","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42581","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47954","text":"For low-stakes decisions — deliberation has a cost"}]}],"id":"blk-42580","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42583","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47955","text":"When there are no cycles (kappa = 0) — nothing to deliberate about"}]}],"id":"blk-42582","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42585","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-47956","text":"Over-deliberation is an anti-pattern — only deliberate when routing recommends it or you suspect contradictions"}]}],"id":"blk-42584","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierav45rxy4p2wyzltli4zd6akqdwe2fndl45v7pzs3lsjycvwla3eaa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}